	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. in domino.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Accepi iis diebus literas tuas, in quibus varia scribis de <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>variis rebus; pleraque verissima, de plerisque autem dubito ob incertum rumorem, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>qui a mercatoribus <placeName ref="l306">Mediolanensibus</placeName> spargitur.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Si <persName ref="p8112">Gallus</persName> <placeName ref="l1122">Parmam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>proditione cępit, erit hoc fomentum futuri belli, etsi id nondum credit d. <lb xml:id="p1z5"/><persName ref="p714">Cęlius</persName>; nam dicit se nosse Caesaris consilia, qui, quod semel cępit, facile <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>non amittat.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Sed brevi fortassis certiora accipiemus hac de r<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>e.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Scribit ad me ex <placeName ref="l749">Saxonia</placeName> hęc verba <persName ref="p8490">Pacęus</persName>: "<lb xml:id="p1z9"/><placeName ref="l303">Magdeburgensium</placeName> res pessime se habent; congrediuntur quotidie fere, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>et miserabilis fratrum inter fratres est strages et cruenta quidem.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Quicunque <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>huius mali causae sunt et autores, non effugient iudicium dei meritum i<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>ustissimumque.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p4176">Amsdorfium</persName> ferunt aufugisse in <placeName ref="l2562">Prussiam</placeName>; sunt et, qui <lb xml:id="p1z13"/><persName ref="p18233">Illyricum</persName> una dicant.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Omnino res in summum discrimen est adducta.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">De <lb xml:id="p1z14"/><placeName ref="l2510">Turca</placeName> feruntur plurima, sed rumoribus non ita authenticis et sine <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>autoribus certis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Proxime deliberatum in aula nostra fuit praesente <persName ref="p2095">Philippo Melanch[thone</persName>] et <lb xml:id="p1z17"/><persName ref="p4503">Camerario</persName> nostro de toto concilii negotio et <persName>Philippo</persName> iniunctum, ut scripto <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>comprehenderet quędam ad hanc rem facientia et ut parentur, si opus sit, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>et progrediatur concilium isthuc <placeName ref="l1107">Tridentinum</placeName>, quantum possit, a nostris omnia.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/><persName ref="p2301">Osiander</persName> cum suis in <placeName ref="l2562">Prussia</placeName> etiam moliri dicitur nescio quę singulari<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>a et mirabilia non minus quam ante obsidionem et bellum <placeName ref="l749">Saxonicum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z22"/><persName ref="p18233">Illyricus</persName> aut quivis alius."</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Considera ex isto scripto, quo propendeat animus nostri <persName ref="p8490">Pacęi</persName>.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Mutamur <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>facile in alios homines iuxta venti flatus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Dominus misereatur nostri.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/><placeName ref="l491">Argentinenses</placeName> vocati sunt ad concilium; consulunt, quid illis sit agendum.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Lętiora invenies in literis d. <persName ref="p8171">Theodori</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Mitto praeterea indicem cum Mandata <placeName ref="l257">Constantientium</placeName>, quem communica <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>d. <persName ref="p8171">Theodoro</persName>; brevi visis libris e nundinis advectis alium i<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>ndicem transmittam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Sitis in domino constantes.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Satan vires ob nostram ingratitudinem <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>resumpsit, qui diu tacuit et simulavit se velle quiescere; sed iam <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>data occasione erumpit cum maximo quorundam malo.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Periculum nobis <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>est a falsis fratribus, quos tandem perdit dominus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>D. <persName ref="p8034">ab Heideck</persName>, <placeName ref="l303">Magdeburgensis</placeName> capitaneus, defecit ad <persName ref="p18250">Mauritium</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>cum militibus; ita enim narrant <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinandini</persName>, et verisimile videtur, <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>quia vocavit ad se suam uxorem, quę iam tuto potest latere in <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinan<lb xml:id="p1z37"/>d<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>i</persName> ditione quęque hactenus apud [nos] latuit et pulchre omnia simulavit.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Vide, quales homines apud nos hospitio excipiamus.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">8. aprilis 1551.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">T[uus] <persName ref="p1278">Gastius</persName> ex animo<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Vigilantissimo pastori d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bull<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ingero</persName>, apud <lb xml:id="p2z5"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinam</placeName> ecclesiam, praeceptor<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>i suo perpetuo co<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>lendo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Zurich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
